{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/chetaslua/status/2121259512414032320","id":"2121259512414032320","text":"GPT-6 Luna is 430x cheaper than Claude Fable 5.1 as an always-on Slack agent , and only 1.1 points behind\n\n> Luna : 6.38/10 , $0.007 a task\n> Fable 5.1 : 7.50/10 , $3.02 a task\n\na proactive agent that reads every thread can't cost $3 a read \n\nFrom Agent Initiative Benchmark by Deepnote researchers @DeepnoteHQ","raw_text":{"text":"GPT-6 Luna is 430x cheaper than Claude Fable 5.1 as an always-on Slack agent , and only 1.1 points behind\n\n> Luna : 6.38/10 , $0.007 a task\n> Fable 5.1 : 7.50/10 , $3.02 a task\n\na proactive agent that reads every thread can't cost $3 a read \n\nFrom Agent Initiative Benchmark by Deepnote researchers @DeepnoteHQ","display_text_range":[0,310],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[284,307],"id":"2121259428716691456","display":"pic.x.com/HHPviMpgeq","original":"https://t.co/HHPviMpgeq","replacement":"https://x.com/chetaslua/status/2121259512414032320/video/1"},{"type":"mention","indices":[299,310],"original":"DeepnoteHQ","id":"1158440148930981888"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"chetaslua","url":"https://x.com/chetaslua","id":"1870923516675289088","followers":45614,"following":258,"likes":16296,"media_count":2087,"name":"Chetaslua","description":"AI researcher & reporter | I test new models on launch day, build working demos, and post prompts + AI jailbreak and behaviour | http://github.com/ChetasLua","raw_description":{"text":"AI researcher & reporter | I test new models on launch day, build working demos, and post prompts + AI jailbreak and behaviour | https://t.co/y96A3VRrMa","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[129,152],"original":"https://t.co/y96A3VRrMa","replacement":"http://github.com/ChetasLua","display":"github.com/ChetasLua"}]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1870923516675289088/1749846996","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1926364057004646400/z3oD9Qy